<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ language }}">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ title }}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f6f8;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#f4f6f8;padding:16px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="640" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width:640px;max-width:100%;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:20px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;">
              <div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;">{{ title }}</div>
              <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:13px;color:#667085;">{{ subtitle }}</div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% if not groups %}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:24px;font-size:14px;color:#667085;">
              За выбранный период релевантных новостей не найдено.
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endif %}
          {% for group in groups %}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:18px 24px 8px 24px;">
                  <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#101828;">{{ group["name"] }}</div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              {% for item in group["items"] %}
              <tr>
                <td style="padding:8px 24px 14px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #f2f4f7;">
                  <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.35;">
                    <a href="{{ item["url"] }}" style="color:#155eef;text-decoration:none;">{{ item["title"] }}</a>
                  </div>
                  <div style="margin-top:4px;font-size:12px;color:#98a2b3;">
                    {{ item["source"] }}{% if item["published_at"] %} · {{ item["published_at"] }}{% endif %}
                  </div>
                  <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#344054;">
                    {{ item["summary"] }}
                  </div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              {% endfor %}
              {% endfor %}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:16px 24px;font-size:12px;color:#98a2b3;">
              Сгенерировано автоматически. Публичные источники. Ссылки ведут на оригиналы.
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
